Our future profitability may depend, in part, on our ability to commercialize our product candidates in foreign markets for
which we may rely on collaboration with third parties. If we commercialize our product candidates in foreign markets, we
would be subject to additional risks and uncertainties, including:
● our customers’ ability to obtain reimbursement for our product candidates in foreign markets;
● our inability to directly control commercial activities because we are relying on third parties;
