The degree of future protection for our proprietary rights is uncertain, and we cannot ensure that:
● any of our pending patent applications, if issued, will include claims having a scope sufficient to protect our
product candidates or any other products or product candidates;
● any of our pending patent applications will issue as patents at all;
● we will be able to successfully commercialize our product candidates, if approved, before our relevant patents
expire;
● we were the first to make the inventions covered by each of our patents and pending patent applications;
